The '''Experimentation Table''' is a {{Rare}} piece of non-cosmetic [[Furniture]] that can be used daily where the player gets to play short games in exchange for {{Skl|Enchanting|XP}}, high level {{Item|Enchanted Book|link=}}s, [[Endcap Enchantments]] and {{Item|Experience Bottle|link=}}s. These games reset 24 hours after consuming the last charge. Extra charges purchasable with {{Bits}} reset every day at 12:00 AM GMT or 7:00 PM EST/8:00 PM EDT. The recipe is unlocked when the player reaches {{Skill|Enchanting X}}.

